go-msx-treegame — unofficial, non-commercial native Go port

This project is an independent, unofficial, non-commercial reimplementation
of the game logic of a 1984 MSX1 cartridge. It is not affiliated with,
authorised, sponsored or endorsed by the original rights holder.

What this repository contains:
  - Original Go source code written for this project.
  - Tools that read a ROM image supplied by the user and extract assets
    from it locally.

What this repository does NOT contain or distribute:
  - The ROM image, or any part of it.
  - Graphics, sound, text or other data extracted from the ROM.
  - A disassembly listing of the ROM.

The engine executes no original machine code: every routine has been
rewritten by hand as ordinary Go. At build time, users must supply their own
legally obtained ROM image, from which the extract tool derives the assets.

All trademarks and copyrights in the original game belong to their
respective owners. If you are a rights holder and have concerns about this
project, please get in touch and it will be addressed promptly.
